"""Integration examples of the reference test_risch.py, test_manual.py and
test_heurisch.py, as the literal call and with integrate in the default,
risch=True, manual=True and heurisch=True modes.

The expected type and printed form were produced by the reference SymPy
1.14 on the same inputs (generated from the differential corpus; exceptions are
compared by type and message; only the cases where symox agrees and that run fast are kept;
heurisch(sin(x)*cos(x)) is left out, its reference form depends on the hash seed).
"""
